<description>&lt;p&gt;Maduro faces a U.S. indictment invoking a rarely used torture law for ordering torture of rivals, while the United States has lifted sanctions on the National Assembly leader and deployed Space Force electromagnetic and electronic warfare systems against Venezuela. The Trump administration is planning changes to Delcy Rodríguez's government and the oil sector, and a Dutch security report warns that Venezuela's instability could threaten Curaçao and the wider Caribbean Kingdom. Opposition groups are mobilising nationwide protests demanding elections and the return of Machado, and workers are pressing the government for real wage recovery. 2 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxObzByT2NGVXJRM1dyM0o2Nm4zNVBualdTWkpKM2NuRm9VUXNQSVhTb3dMY2d0SnpJZFJqeU1sTlZCcTVLX3B0M1V5TjAtNDVGMGdaU0xRbU9zYUFZN2xQM2dFczBVSFNSR01qUkhHXzdpSC14RmdrdW5DajJrZFRJTWZia3puU29rRDV4dzB3a2V3YWJjbUlqWXlRY0Z5Q0hTb3hGZVVzbGRUb3VLZHM5dzdDZlc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPSThkVlA4a1BiZmExS0k4djM2cmEwaXliX2k5eUFnLU9qM2x6X0llMkU5QjhiNWxZLVI0SzF6Ykc5aEVVTTFydjF4MzgtVHJPRU10V2tFM0prSWRDVWJiU2pUaFNlLWo0eGd3dmtwNjFZYk1HLUVreW1rMzhKUDZ2Wm9FNzFFVnZGVE51REU1aWY?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Devdiscourse&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE1KZUJNSXFmNWtvZ3BxNDVQeWhPZHcxZlp4cWdaQVBsdG1uODV0RXh4SHV6QnJsU21OZnUyeEkwVm1Udlk0b2tBcXBrdzZZN2wyenZXbGFQNTM?oc=5&quot;&gt;CubaHeadlines&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQeklEY1RhVjZhSjdFQnEwcGttZHZva09sX0FuYTE3ampYdzJhYUpybWVzaG56U3o0U21EbHlsaFFxOW5YWnRXQ0pseFhMbERUdkcxWmVtQ0dCeFpsalhaYllCTVBvZ3FPY